{
 "id": "seg4",
 "title": "三类价格源",
 "pill": 4,
 "total": 117.46,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "换掉现货价，有三类选择。",
   "spoken": "换掉现货价，有三类选择。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.4,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 3.773
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "第一类，AMM 的时间加权平均价，简称 TWAP。",
   "spoken": "第一类，AMM 的时间加权平均价，简称 TWAP。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-01.wav",
   "start": 4.22,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 4.22,
   "speechEnd": 9.41
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "它把一段时间里的价格，按时间加权求平均。",
   "spoken": "它把一段时间里的价格，按时间加权求平均。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-02.wav",
   "start": 9.88,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 9.97,
   "speechEnd": 13.749
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "一笔交易推高的价格，在平均里只占一小段，几乎不起作用。",
   "spoken": "一笔交易推高的价格，在平均里只占一小段，几乎不起作用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-03.wav",
   "start": 14.18,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 14.274,
   "speechEnd": 19.41
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "代价是，窗口越长，价格越滞后。",
   "spoken": "代价是，窗口越常，价格越滞后。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-04.wav",
   "start": 19.84,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speechStart": 19.931,
   "speechEnd": 23.138
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "而低流动性的池子，仍然可以被连续多个区块持续操纵。",
   "spoken": "而低流动性的池子，仍然可以被连续多个区块持续操纵。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-05.wav",
   "start": 23.58,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 23.672,
   "speechEnd": 28.106
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "在 PoS 下，同一个提议者连续出块时，这种操纵会更便宜。",
   "spoken": "在 PoS 下，同一个提议者连续出块时，这种操纵会更便宜。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-06.wav",
   "start": 28.52,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 28.616,
   "speechEnd": 33.472
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "2022 年 4 月的 Inverse Finance，就是这样。",
   "spoken": "2022 年 4 月的 Inverse Finance，就是这样。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-07.wav",
   "start": 33.94,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speechStart": 34.045,
   "speechEnd": 37.236
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "攻击者没有用闪电贷。他投入自有资金，持续推高浅池里的 INV 价格。",
   "spoken": "攻击者没有用闪电贷。他投入自有资金，持续推高浅池里的 INV 价格。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-08.wav",
   "start": 37.68,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 37.68,
   "speechEnd": 43.508
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "同时用垃圾交易抑制套利，让 TWAP 输出虚高的价格。",
   "spoken": "同时用垃圾交易抑制套利，让 TWAP 输出虚高的价格。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-09.wav",
   "start": 43.9,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 43.9,
   "speechEnd": 49.231
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "按公开报道，借走约 1560 万美元。",
   "spoken": "按公开报道，借走约 1560 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-10.wav",
   "start": 49.64,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 49.739,
   "speechEnd": 53.545
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "TWAP 挡得住一笔交易，挡不住有资本的多区块操纵。",
   "spoken": "TWAP 挡得住一笔交易，挡不住有资本的多区块操纵。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-11.wav",
   "start": 53.94,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 53.94,
   "speechEnd": 58.102
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "第二类，链下聚合预言机，比如 Chainlink。",
   "spoken": "第二类，链下聚合预言机，比如 Chainlink。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-12.wav",
   "start": 58.56,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 58.654,
   "speechEnd": 62.332
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "价格在链下聚合，再写上链。一笔交易改不动它。",
   "spoken": "价格在链下聚合，再写上链。一笔交易改不动它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-13.wav",
   "start": 62.78,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 62.78,
   "speechEnd": 67.031
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "它按心跳和偏离阈值更新。",
   "spoken": "它按心跳和偏离阈值更新。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-14.wav",
   "start": 67.48,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 67.48,
   "speechEnd": 69.943
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "心跳，是价格不变时，也必须更新的最长间隔。",
   "spoken": "心跳，是价格不变时，也必须更新的最常间隔。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-15.wav",
   "start": 70.34,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 70.34,
   "speechEnd": 74.871
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "它的风险换了方向：价格可能过时，可能撞上上下限，节点和喂价方也可能失效。",
   "spoken": "它的风险换了方向：价格可能过时，可能撞上上下限，节点和喂价方也可能失效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-16.wav",
   "start": 75.28,
   "dur": 8.16,
   "speechStart": 75.28,
   "speechEnd": 83.285
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "第三类，多源组合。几个价格源互相比较，偏离超过阈值就暂停。",
   "spoken": "第三类，多源组合。几个价格源互相比较，偏离超过阈值就暂停。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-17.wav",
   "start": 83.66,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 83.66,
   "speechEnd": 89.354
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "它更稳，但实现复杂。几个源意见不一时听谁的，要提前想好。",
   "spoken": "它更稳，但实现复杂。几个源意见不一时听谁的，要提前想好。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-18.wav",
   "start": 89.8,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 89.892,
   "speechEnd": 95.571
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-19",
   "text": "顺带一句，LP 代币也不能按储备乘现货价来定价。",
   "spoken": "顺带一句，LP 代币也不能按储备乘现货价来定价。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-19.wav",
   "start": 96.02,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 96.02,
   "speechEnd": 100.57
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-20",
   "text": "要用外部预言机的价格和不变量，反推出公平储备，再算 LP 的价值。",
   "spoken": "要用外部预言机的价格和不变量，反推出公平储备，再算 LP 的价值。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-20.wav",
   "start": 100.96,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 100.96,
   "speechEnd": 106.77
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-21",
   "text": "没有完美的预言机。",
   "spoken": "没有完美的预言机。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-21.wav",
   "start": 107.18,
   "dur": 1.84,
   "speechStart": 107.275,
   "speechEnd": 108.787
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-22",
   "text": "工程上要回答两个问题。",
   "spoken": "工程上要回答两个问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-22.wav",
   "start": 109.24,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "speechStart": 109.337,
   "speechEnd": 111.554
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-23",
   "text": "价格错了，会怎样？价格停了，会怎样？",
   "spoken": "价格错了，会怎样？价格停了，会怎样？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-23.wav",
   "start": 112.02,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 112.02,
   "speechEnd": 116.028
  }
